# hsk py check

After completing code changes, run `hsk py check` and fix until it passes.

Do not finish while check-all still fails, unless the failure is environmental and cannot be fixed in code.

## Cross-project check

The following projects are linked:

- `harrix-swiss-knife`
- `harrix-pylib`
- `harrix-pyssg`

If changes are made to **any** of these projects, run `hsk py check` in **every** project from the list above (not just the one that was modified), and fix all errors in each of them before finishing.

Do not finish until `hsk py check` passes in all listed projects, unless a failure is environmental and cannot be fixed in code.
